    <h2>FAQ</h2>

    <h3>Is Smallpdf or iLovePDF completely free?</h3>
    <p>Both offer free tiers, but with limitations. Smallpdf limits you to 2 tasks per day on the free plan, while iLovePDF is unlimited but shows ads. For serious PDF work, both services offer paid plans that remove restrictions, with iLovePDF Pro starting at $7 per month and Smallpdf Pro starting at $12 per month.</p>

    <h3>Are my files safe with these online PDF editors?</h3>
    <p>Yes. Both services use SSL encryption and automatically delete uploaded files after processing, typically within 1 hour. Smallpdf adds an extra layer with GDPR compliance and ISO 27001 certification. For highly sensitive legal or medical documents, a desktop PDF editor may still be preferable, but both Smallpdf and iLovePDF are safe for everyday PDF work.</p>

    <h3>Which is better for compressing PDF files?</h3>
    <p>iLovePDF is generally better for compression. It offers three compression levels (basic, recommended, and extreme) and produces smaller file sizes with less quality loss. Smallpdf also compresses effectively but offers fewer options. For users who need maximum compression for email attachments or web uploads, iLovePDF is the stronger choice.</p>

    <h3>Can I merge and split PDFs with both tools?</h3>
    <p>Yes, both Smallpdf and iLovePDF support merging multiple PDFs into one file and splitting a PDF into multiple files. iLovePDF also lets you reorder pages within a merged document and extract specific page ranges, while Smallpdf keeps the merge and split process simpler but with fewer options.</p>

    <h3>Do Smallpdf and iLovePDF support OCR for scanned documents?</h3>
    <p>Yes, both support OCR (Optical Character Recognition) on paid plans, which converts scanned PDFs and images into searchable, editable text. iLovePDF supports OCR in over 30 languages and handles multi-page scans well. Smallpdf also supports OCR but with slightly fewer language options. For users who regularly work with scanned documents, iLovePDF has a slight edge.</p>

    <h3>Which has better pricing, Smallpdf or iLovePDF?</h3>
    <p>iLovePDF is more affordable. iLovePDF Pro starts at $7 per month (billed annually) and includes unlimited tasks, OCR, and no ads. Smallpdf Pro starts at $12 per month (billed annually) and includes unlimited tasks and OCR but costs nearly double. For users on a budget, iLovePDF is the better value; for users who prioritize a polished interface and ISO-certified security, Smallpdf may be worth the premium.</p>

